#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1665
msgid "This plugin is set to combine JavaScript into a bundle. Combining moves scripts away from the inline snippets that belong to them, which is a common cause of console errors across a site. Gating survives it, but if anything looks wrong, exclude the files below first."
